<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 30.965 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 30.965 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate, TIIE, rose 184 basis points to 30.965 percent Wednesday from 29.1250 percent Tuesday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>TIIP, meanwhile, advanced more than 501 basis points to 30.9678 percent Wednesday from 25.9533 percent the week before.</p>
<p>TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558</p>
</text>
